 #### bindMethods(target, methodNames?)
 
 Bind the given `methodNames`, or all `Emittery` methods if `methodNames` is not defined, into the `target` object.
+Binding is atomic: conflicts are checked before any methods are installed. Properties with non-`undefined` values,
+including inherited values, non-configurable own properties, and missing properties on non-extensible targets cause the
+operation to throw without changing the target. Duplicate method names are treated as one binding request.
 
